{"unit_id":"rikfish163-rgb__dsh-pets#feature-4","repo":"rikfish163-rgb/dsh-pets","commit":"37242bbc4e2003f86639cb023d36b7b25a7a0cc2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pets 的功能「任务详情与会话跳转」：点击任务卡片可展开详情，并可用“打开会话”跳转到关联会话；面板还提供 DSH Web 首页、会话和插件管理快捷入口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:308-359"]}
{"unit_id":"rikfish163-rgb__dsh-pets#caveat-1","repo":"rikfish163-rgb/dsh-pets","commit":"37242bbc4e2003f86639cb023d36b7b25a7a0cc2","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pets 会把已完成任务历史写入本机 DSH storage，并把上传的宠物图片放在插件 assets/uploads 目录；历史最多保留 200 条。见 lib/index.js:21-23、97-105、353-370。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-23","lib/index.js:97-105","lib/index.js:353-370"]}
